  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Drain sweetcorn.\n• Heat a large frying pan over high heat. Cook corn until charred, 4-5 mins. Transfer to a large bowl.\n• Meanwhile, finely chop brown onion. Finely chop or crush garlic. Drain and rinse lentils.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-65434031c845c69ff694fd65-25896d0e.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Return frying pan to medium-high heat, with a drizzle of olive oil. Cook onion, stirring, until softened, 4-5 mins.\n• Add garlic, all-purpose seasoning and BBQ spice blend (add less if you're sensitive to heat!) and cook until fragrant, 1 min.\n• Stir in lentils, the brown sugar, 1/2 the passata, a splash of water and the butter, cook until slightly thickened, 2-3 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-65434031c845c69ff694fd65-ac605dd5.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Preheat grill to medium-high.\n• Lay mini flour tortillas on a flat surface. Divide lentil filling between tortillas(about 1/2 cup each). Roll up tightly and place, seam-side down, in a baking dish, ensuring they fit snugly.\n• Pour remaining passata over rolled tortillas. Sprinkle with cheese and grill until warmed through and cheese is golden, 8-10 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-65434031c845c69ff694fd65-4c047c57.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Finely chop tomato.\n• Add tomato, a drizzle of white wine vinegar and olive oil to the corn. Toss to combine. Season to taste.\n• Divide enchiladas between plates. Top with salsa. Serve with sour cream.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-65434031c845c69ff694fd65-22c8685f.jpeg"
    }
  ]
